# Prevaro Add-ons for Claude ignore list.
# NOTE: Claude Code 2.1.322 does not read .claudeignore (verified: no reference in the binary).
# The same patterns are enforced through permissions.deny in ~/.claude/settings.json
# (see claude-home/settings.fragment.json). This file is kept as documentation and
# for tools that do read .claudeignore.
